I just got the ca0106 drivers, 1.0.10rc1, for use with my SB live 24 
bit, model 0410.  I noticed a new slider in the mixer for the input, and 
by turning up the feedback slider, I was able to get passthrough audio 
from the input to my speakers.  Good work guys!

OSS emulation is definately working for playing (xmms, flash), but no 
recording yet.

If anyone needs anything tested with this card (something I can run and 
give you the results), please let me know off the list.

Keep up the good work!

